        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate physics runner game set in a vibrant, neon-themed world! Navigate through dazzling landscapes filled with glowing obstacles, collect shimmering coins, and unlock a variety of exciting new themes and balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/3c7ad1b9cbcc533350ab9cba2a0b92a5.poster.avif?t=1762341386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/3c7ad1b9cbcc533350ab9cba2a0b92a5.webm?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/3c7ad1b9cbcc533350ab9cba2a0b92a5.mp4?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Obstacles: Skilfully manoeuvre your ball to avoid a variety of obstacles that come your way. From spinning blades to moving platforms, each level presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Coins: Gather as many coins as you can while rolling through the neon-lit paths. Use these coins to unlock new themes and balls, enhancing your gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New Themes and Balls: Customize your game with a range of neon themes and unique balls. Each theme offers a fresh visual experience, and new balls come with special abilities to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/1e849870aaea3afb38a91c60b56c2f47.poster.avif?t=1762341386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/1e849870aaea3afb38a91c60b56c2f47.webm?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/1e849870aaea3afb38a91c60b56c2f47.mp4?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Neon Graphics: Immerse yourself in a world of vibrant neon lights and futuristic designs. The visually striking graphics make every run a feast for the eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Levels: Test your reflexes and skills with progressively challenging levels. Each level is meticulously designed to keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive Controls: Enjoy smooth and responsive controls that make navigating through the neon world a breeze. Whether you’re a casual player or a hardcore gamer, you’ll find the controls easy to master.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate physics runner game set in a vibrant, neon-themed world! Navigate through dazzling landscapes filled with glowing obstacles, collect shimmering coins, and unlock a variety of exciting new themes and balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/3c7ad1b9cbcc533350ab9cba2a0b92a5.poster.avif?t=1762341386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/3c7ad1b9cbcc533350ab9cba2a0b92a5.webm?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/3c7ad1b9cbcc533350ab9cba2a0b92a5.mp4?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Obstacles: Skilfully manoeuvre your ball to avoid a variety of obstacles that come your way. From spinning blades to moving platforms, each level presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Coins: Gather as many coins as you can while rolling through the neon-lit paths. Use these coins to unlock new themes and balls, enhancing your gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New Themes and Balls: Customize your game with a range of neon themes and unique balls. Each theme offers a fresh visual experience, and new balls come with special abilities to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/1e849870aaea3afb38a91c60b56c2f47.poster.avif?t=1762341386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/1e849870aaea3afb38a91c60b56c2f47.webm?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044240/extras/1e849870aaea3afb38a91c60b56c2f47.mp4?t=1762341386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Neon Graphics: Immerse yourself in a world of vibrant neon lights and futuristic designs. The visually striking graphics make every run a feast for the eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Levels: Test your reflexes and skills with progressively challenging levels. Each level is meticulously designed to keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive Controls: Enjoy smooth and responsive controls that make navigating through the neon world a breeze. Whether you’re a casual player or a hardcore gamer, you’ll find the controls easy to master.</p>",
